cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TOTEN: Typed Ontological Tokenization"
abstract: >-
  Knowledge-based ontological tokenization that replaces statistical vocabulary derivation with
  declarative classification grounded in a formal ontology of engineering entities (OEE),
  deterministically coupled to three external oracles (Pint, the Unicode Character Database,
  and RSLP).
type: software
